grund.toml is read as version 2.

mistitled-field
A field's heading is titled differently from the title its kind gives it.

Severity: by strength: the field's presence: must an error, warn a warning, should a suggestion, may an error.
On: when [schema.kinds.<kind>.fields.<field>] title is set (a setting)
Fix: retitle the heading to match

Next: grund config explain '[schema.kinds.<kind>.fields.<field>]'
